  "description": "When a mana stone is stolen from the powerful Red Dragon, it morphs into a noble lady to track down the thief. This lady is none other than Cecilia Marinella, who was proclaimed dead five years ago under suspicious circumstances. With no memory of Cecilia’s past, the dragon starts its search with the men closest to her. Could any of them lead it to the mana stone? And just what do they know about Cecilia’s “death”? Soon, the search for the stone and the search for the truth become entangled... \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
